---
// Side-by-side showdown contrasting how elevation is communicated in
// Light mode (wider drop shadows on white surfaces) vs Dark mode (lighter surface tiers + 1px top highlight).
const uid = Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8);
const W = 900;
const H = 344;
---
<figure class="ddms">
  <div class="ddms-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Side-by-side comparison of Light mode and Dark mode elevation. On the left in Light mode, a white card and a white popover rise above an off-white canvas using progressively wider drop shadows. On the right in Dark mode, dark shadows vanish so height is communicated by stepping surface lightness upward from #15120E canvas to #221E18 card to #312B23 popover with subtle 1px top highlight edges.">
      <defs>
        <filter id={`ddms-l2-${uid}`} x="-12%" y="-12%" width="124%" height="140%">
          <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="4" stdDeviation="4" flood-color="#261f16" flood-opacity="0.12" />
          <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="1" stdDeviation="1.5" flood-color="#261f16" flood-opacity="0.10" />
        </filter>
        <filter id={`ddms-l4-${uid}`} x="-16%" y="-16%" width="132%" height="150%">
          <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="12" stdDeviation="11" flood-color="#261f16" flood-opacity="0.18" />
        </filter>
      </defs>

      <!-- LEFT PANEL: Light mode -->
      <rect x="24" y="16" width="410" height="310" rx="10" class="ddms-panel" />
      <text x="44" y="44" class="ddms-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Light mode: shadows signal height</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Giao diện sáng: bóng đổ báo độ cao</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Light canvas stage -->
      <rect x="44" y="60" width="370" height="222" rx="9" fill="#f6f4ef" stroke="#dfd9ce" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="58" y="82" fill="#6b665f" font-size="12" font-weight="600">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Canvas · #F6F4EF</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nền chính · #F6F4EF</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Light card (L2) -->
      <rect x="64" y="96" width="328" height="122" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e6e1d7" stroke-width="1" filter={`url(#ddms-l2-${uid})`} />
      <text x="80" y="121" fill="#262421" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Card · #FFFFFF (shadow-md)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thẻ nội dung · #FFFFFF (shadow-md)</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="80" y1="138" x2="220" y2="138" stroke="#c8c2b6" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <line x1="80" y1="154" x2="180" y2="154" stroke="#dcd6cb" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />

      <!-- Light popover (L4) -->
      <rect x="150" y="156" width="224" height="104" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e6e1d7" stroke-width="1" filter={`url(#ddms-l4-${uid})`} />
      <text x="166" y="182" fill="#262421" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Popover · #FFFFFF (shadow-xl)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hộp nổi · #FFFFFF (shadow-xl)</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="166" y1="201" x2="310" y2="201" stroke="#c8c2b6" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <line x1="166" y1="220" x2="262" y2="220" stroke="#b3402f" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <line x1="166" y1="238" x2="288" y2="238" stroke="#dcd6cb" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />

      <text x="229" y="306" text-anchor="middle" class="ddms-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Same white surface; wider blur separates layers</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng nền trắng; bóng rộng hơn tách biệt từng tầng</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- RIGHT PANEL: Dark mode -->
      <rect x="466" y="16" width="410" height="310" rx="10" class="ddms-panel" />
      <text x="486" y="44" class="ddms-h is-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Dark mode: lighter tiers signal height</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dark mode: bề mặt sáng hơn báo độ cao</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Dark canvas stage -->
      <rect x="486" y="60" width="370" height="222" rx="9" fill="#15120e" stroke="#2d2720" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="500" y="82" fill="#9c9488" font-size="12" font-weight="600">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Canvas · #15120E (7% L)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nền chính · #15120E (7% L)</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Dark card (L2) -->
      <rect x="506" y="96" width="328" height="122" rx="8" fill="#231e18" stroke="#362f26" stroke-width="1" />
      <line x1="513" y1="97" x2="827" y2="97" stroke="#52483b" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <text x="522" y="121" fill="#f0ece6" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Card · #231E18 (12% L)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thẻ nội dung · #231E18 (12% L)</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="522" y1="138" x2="662" y2="138" stroke="#5b5246" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <line x1="522" y1="154" x2="622" y2="154" stroke="#423b32" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />

      <!-- Dark popover (L4) -->
      <rect x="592" y="156" width="224" height="104" rx="8" fill="#322b23" stroke="#4c4337" stroke-width="1" />
      <line x1="599" y1="157" x2="809" y2="157" stroke="#756858" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <text x="608" y="182" fill="#faf8f4" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Popover · #322B23 (17% L)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hộp nổi · #322B23 (17% L)</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="608" y1="201" x2="752" y2="201" stroke="#72685b" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <line x1="608" y1="220" x2="704" y2="220" stroke="#e06c5a" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <line x1="608" y1="238" x2="730" y2="238" stroke="#554d42" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />

      <text x="671" y="306" text-anchor="middle" class="ddms-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Step lightness +5% per tier + 1px top highlight</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tăng sáng +5% mỗi bậc + viền sáng 1px mép trên</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Dark shadows vanish against a dark canvas. In dark mode, step surface lightness upward by 4–5% per elevation tier and add a crisp 1px top-edge highlight.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bóng tối chìm hẳn trên nền tối. Ở dark mode, hãy nâng độ sáng bề mặt thêm 4–5% cho mỗi bậc độ cao và thêm vệt sáng 1px ở mép trên.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ddms { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ddms-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ddms svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ddms text { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ddms-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .ddms text.ddms-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ddms text.ddms-h.is-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .ddms text.ddms-sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ddms figcaption { margin-top: 0.6em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
